{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1773906324_234401_9c35074726d742758620f677dac1607c.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">• About our brand and products:</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">BBiMP, the streetwear division of OLD ORDER, was established in Tokyo, Japan, in 2020 with an emphasis on Generation Z design. The brand aims to build a “fun toy kingdom”, blending playful and unconventional elements into its design style.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">At the same time, BBiMP is deeply rooted in street culture, adhering to a unique and independent design philosophy. The brand specializes in creating niche, avant-garde sneakers and apparel, rejecting uniform aesthetics. By combining high-quality craftsmanship with bold, individualistic design, BBiMP offers a diverse, personalized fashion experience for those who pursue distinctive style. Every single piece is designed to serve as a vehicle for self-expression.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Affiliates earn a percentage commission for every successful order generated through their unique referral link or discount code.<br>Commissions are calculated based on completed and non-refunded purchases.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>• How to promote us:</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Create engaging content on TikTok or Instagram featuring our products.<br>Share your unique referral link or discount code in your bio or captions to drive sales.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p></div></div>",
